@startuml
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
title CSC207 Account & General Profile - Clean Architecture
package "Frameworks & Drivers" {
  class "Swing Views" as Views
  class "FileUserDataAccessObject" as FileDAO
  class "InMemoryUserDataAccessObject" as MemoryDAO
  class "Pbkdf2PasswordHasher" as HashAdapter
}
package "Interface Adapters" {
  class "Signup/Login/Logout/Profile/ChangePassword Controllers" as Controllers
  class "Signup/Login/Logout/Profile/ChangePassword Presenters" as Presenters
  class "ViewModels" as ViewModels
}
package "Use Cases" {
  interface "Input Boundaries" as Inputs
  class "Interactors" as Interactors
  interface "Output Boundaries" as Outputs
  interface "DAO Interfaces" as DAO
  interface "PasswordHasher" as HashPort
  interface "CurrentUserSession" as SessionPort
}
package "Entities" {
  class "User" as User
  class "UserFactory" as UserFactory
}
Views --> Controllers : user events
Views --> ViewModels : observes
Controllers --> Inputs : calls
Interactors ..|> Inputs : implements
Interactors --> Outputs : presents result
Presenters ..|> Outputs : implements
Presenters --> ViewModels : updates
Interactors --> DAO : account operations
FileDAO ..|> DAO : implements
MemoryDAO ..|> DAO : implements
Interactors --> HashPort : hashes / verifies
HashAdapter ..|> HashPort : implements
Interactors --> SessionPort : signed-in username
Interactors --> User : uses
Interactors --> UserFactory : creates
note right of Views
Katelyn's Friends/Pin components
are inserted as JComponents,
not implemented by Rohail.
end note
@enduml
